    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf49532581bcfbe4d4197eae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……就这样，她向两人发出\n挑战书这一件事成为了一大话题——",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ea7c2f01a7f79497460d91aedc2b2fee820c999a046ffa184cab14f243b56f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beef97b4249732c6b99337c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『樱花赏』以比历年任何时候都要热闹的氛围，到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f34168af859b1eae6d893361b7569ce9f0bb90abdc8f6de0bf65c675cf5ab44e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21220ce17e5327d31d6a43dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb12aa42f9fd0aba9267db5c2901cc53c437e87018d0410f3ecfe9561c0f158a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19984ebf68b53b99114e98c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……很好啊。SNS也热火朝天。\n消息飞速传播。好时代来临了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "450f94df05a584b4dd6c21dce6265a9b6fd1cccff61b3bc62056d93517e60380",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe34be1742b8d1b99f0f517",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb12aa42f9fd0aba9267db5c2901cc53c437e87018d0410f3ecfe9561c0f158a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbc3d689920c872254551f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "关注到手。\n这样就是从未有过的华丽登场了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "361fb646c5a749c8232733c44e0a56fcd92228d4781c1ec9d3f5de668a088e1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a24ca0e633df46cd43a1fce2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『阪神JF』上展现实力、一跃成名的\n伏特加，与把她当作对手的\n大和赤骥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6663d1b372725cc437d0f2ed4dfe30e527ec15b9fd0fb86f3867af46039f7236",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f693e3a97e3c52f5de8bffb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "加上在学园内的关系，\n两人之间的关系让很多人的内心都炽热起来。 ",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b85c9232155196b144d75f722fe2aacbe4320302e61bac357eb7c0187d1985b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa26b44dbf28ad1e60d6f8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那两人的激烈冲突一直\n引人注目。而在这样的『樱花赏』上，作为\n被人遗忘的第三势力横插进来——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e372d8479d0d404f1e81afe85482fa54cddea50f8fe7a84e0289ac340c115f33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:313eb657addd6803510546b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（不，一定，……不是偶然）",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc594a8eb048ab896c9e4498c9eb4b2bcf118e21deca2f7a3f69a9282527d4d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876e5f74f948d203bd88d496",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车偶然间，\n得到了至今未有过的关注度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4fee59f292971aac4f39364846a7c6b9e84246d4b2594d002c780cc6f97a9d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d55d8becb92399e3e5c40b19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今我终于明白了。\n她曾说过的话的意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "724d9d8198c82d84094b312c4cd17e2b33c6aae64ceb66c5c75e7910d0cc496d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d6fa95b9673161d7454112",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb12aa42f9fd0aba9267db5c2901cc53c437e87018d0410f3ecfe9561c0f158a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24700778b7ead5ea83d5a5ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是小真一个人攀不上去的火炬。\n鲜明炽烈，十分浪漫。\n谁都将仰望它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94682895c7f43fde3a62bfaf4e22cc41d3955e8e5295d11faf63861a71e261b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e2d531ba4890a0cdf595610",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阪神赛场被热烈的欢呼所包围。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d59ea9f39656eb228354b928d6e4817592869bf9030f69d61f55ac30b07fc994",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84f57962f64a347cfbfe655",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb12aa42f9fd0aba9267db5c2901cc53c437e87018d0410f3ecfe9561c0f158a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2baaa975c643c0581eaffd7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后万事俱备，小真闪亮登场。\n这才能说是，盛放的大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "449968a83bea7b9744d155327de384ba65f4b0ad2f1d0af970f45242ef58cded",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e0cf36f81db738c5df3272",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……不过，即便如此）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63e64e65b0d48be9bc7251f1b0421d11be8a0ffdedeea233d45b58101382e5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e595f7d41e6032cf7b31a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道做了什么，她\n似乎从那时开始就一直\n为最闪亮的舞台“樱花赏”做着准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "249722f5527f9ef2428725b62c3b6ba47b8b126d3de5fe3d08eeb4d743769843",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56c21fa2167dd22cbce2715b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（所以才为了这场比赛那样地……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ac3b7ad9cc95a81650d80a8078ef9634fafd48f478a95d16daca39ef5606b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772ac5cc64e119405edd8225",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到底真弓快车如果不是\n强力马娘的话——横插进对决\n只会使得尴尬冷场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db21d4ac503fc92fa32ba75d755c849d7131dd0ed7f9d9f7446eca01add5947e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73832bb0ba1745a073769fa3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我不禁叹息出声。\n这不是决定想做就能做成的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "038aba87ef9fdf4b4d7d333604b9be5599053530228f7b56e539d8c4af594efe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65bc3864e25549ce839bd389",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "必需的是明显的实力和——",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c17b857952736c024e29057973ce6182fa1ebd69bd5915b14710ec835e5db5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e54ee1e0700c0b6bba9d2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb12aa42f9fd0aba9267db5c2901cc53c437e87018d0410f3ecfe9561c0f158a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae3ee725e3051af36ee5715c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小真，\n要成为超超级吉祥物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41cb0327908c4f4006dfc430219daf421d3169ad48359c76bed6b8749e3f8208",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d6a5a35d48ee44a3c4fe56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb12aa42f9fd0aba9267db5c2901cc53c437e87018d0410f3ecfe9561c0f158a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768975fe352f821d7bc6419d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……一定，一定，一定会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c7ab72b71d14a02118dae9c2d9efc12e8042a38babd8d8c0dfdba852b814cd0",
